<title>USA: Computer Products names O'Donnell chairman.</title>
<headline>Computer Products names O'Donnell chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Products Inc Wednesday said its board elected Joseph O'Donnell to serve as chairman of the board of directors, in addition to his current positions of president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The position of chairman of the board of directors was vacant prior to O'Donnell's appointment, the company said.</p>
